  "title": "Urgent UK Recall: Popular Toy Story Kids’ Water Bottle Pulled From Home Bargains Over Choking Risk",
  "summary": "Parents Warned After Popular Kids’ Bottle Is Recalled Due to Loose Part Hazard A popular children’s product sold across the UK has been urgently recalled after safety checks revealed a potential choking hazard. Parents and guardians have been advised to stop children from using the item immediately and to keep it away from young children until it has been returned or safely disposed of. The recalled product is a Toy Story themed water bottle sold by discount retailer Home Bargains. The recall",
